@startuml 04_clases
title Diagrama de Clases - Cajero Automático (capa Logic)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Customer {
  - _name : string
  - _nationalId : string
  + Customer(name : string, nationalId : string)
}

class Card {
  + {static} MaximumPinAttempts : int = 3
  - _number : string {readOnly}
  - _expirationDate : DateTime {readOnly}
  - _status : CardStatus
  - _pinAttempts : int {readOnly}
  + Card(number : string, expirationDate : DateTime)
  + IsValid() : bool
  + RegisterFailedAttempt() : int
  + Block() : void
}

class Account {
  - _cbu : string {readOnly}
  - _availableBalance : decimal
  - _totalBalance : decimal
  + Account(cbu : string, availableBalance : decimal, totalBalance : decimal)
  + UpdateBalance(available : decimal, total : decimal) : void
}

class Session {
  - _state : SessionState {readOnly}
  - _startTime : DateTime {readOnly}
  - _message : string {readOnly}
  + Session()
  + InsertCard(number : string, expirationDate : DateTime) : bool
  + Authenticate(pin : string) : bool
  + Execute(operation : Operation) : bool
  + NewBalanceInquiry() : Operation
  + NewCashWithdrawal(amount : decimal) : Operation
  + NewTransfer(destinationCbu : string, amount : decimal) : Operation
  + Finish() : void
  + GenerateReceipt() : string
  + Close() : void
}

abstract class Operation {
  # _amount : decimal
  # _timestamp : DateTime {readOnly}
  # _referenceNumber : string
  # _message : string
  + {abstract} OperationType : string {readOnly}
  # Operation(central : CentralDB, card : Card, account : Account, amount : decimal)
  + {abstract} Execute() : bool
  + ToString() : string
}

class BalanceInquiry {
  + BalanceInquiry(central : CentralDB, card : Card, account : Account)
  + Execute() : bool
}

class CashWithdrawal {
  + CashWithdrawal(central : CentralDB, card : Card, account : Account, amount : decimal)
  + Execute() : bool
}

class Transfer {
  - _destinationCbu : string
  + Transfer(central : CentralDB, card : Card, account : Account, destinationCbu : string, amount : decimal)
  + Execute() : bool
}

Operation <|-- BalanceInquiry
Operation <|-- CashWithdrawal
Operation <|-- Transfer

Session "1" *-- "0..*" Operation : records >
Session "1" --> "0..1" Card : uses >
Session "1" --> "1" Account : operates on >
Session "1" --> "1" Customer : serves >
Operation "0..*" --> "1" Card : identifies with >
Operation "0..*" --> "1" Account : affects >

note as layers
  Clases de la consigna (nombres en inglés): Cliente = Customer, Tarjeta = Card, Cuenta = Account,
  Sesion = Session, Operacion = Operation, Consulta = BalanceInquiry, Extraccion = CashWithdrawal,
  Transferencia = Transfer. Las propiedades públicas (get/set) de cada atributo no se dibujan.
  BranchDB (SucursalDB), CentralDB (capa Data) y CajeroForm (FormCajero, capa Presentation,
  la :PantallaCajero de las secuencias) no forman parte de las 8 clases.
end note
@enduml
